msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:90
#: 5bfda6c2fd544bce998f0eb234dfaec5 5cd35685f4064b9d86a267129ebc4aa0
#: 62d9c688db884e44bcf371b0181a8e28 bab7e9868feb4209a3cd492af6a22633
#: e7a1ce2f13ef4b57bcb3fc30d5cfd9cc f7427c7ac1f246efacde9c6bc2ce0397
msgid ""
"If the JP jumper is bridged to PIT then GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output "
"to pins marked \"10V\" and is included on the HD VTX connector. Setting this"
" GPIO low removes voltage supply to this pin/pad. RELAY2 is configured by "
"default to control this GPIO and is high by default."
msgstr ""
"如果 JP 跳线桥接到 PIT，则 GPIO 81 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标记为「10V」的引脚，并包含在 HD VTX 连接器上。将此 GPIO"
" 设置为低电平会切断该引脚/焊盘的电源。RELAY2 默认配置为控制此 GPIO，默认为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsh7hdv2.rst:93
#: 50b92cfce9f1411dafafa43aefc6d0e7 6e8eaf310b81401eabacd9e8041d584b
