#: c0680e9b7daa44c68f03544cb2c3328c f4e9f354ea66405b80d48924deb821d2
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 is marked as \"OSD\". It can be used as a general GPIO pin. By "
"default RELAY4 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high at "
"boot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 标记为「OSD」，可用作通用 GPIO 引脚。默认情况下，RELAY4 配置为控制此引脚，并在启动时将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

